§ `sch 3A para 7(2) -- para 7(2) the property is comprised in a person's estate`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7(2) the property is comprised in a person's estate` WITH `the person is beneficially entitled to the property` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 'means': property to which the person is not beneficially entitled is not in the estate
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7(2) the property is comprised in a person's estate` WITH `the person is beneficially entitled to the property` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `sch 3A para 7(1) -- para 7(1) the trust is a trust effected by will holding only the estat`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7(1) the trust is a trust effected by will holding only the estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was effected by will` IS TRUE, `the person was beneficially entitled to all the property the trust holds` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) the day before the second anniversary of the death
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7(1) the trust is a trust effected by will holding only the estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was effected by will` IS TRUE, `the person was beneficially entitled to all the property the trust holds` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) the second anniversary itself: outside the period
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7(1) the trust is a trust effected by will holding only the estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was effected by will` IS TRUE, `the person was beneficially entitled to all the property the trust holds` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 10 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a) the trust holds property the person was not beneficially entitled to: the "where" in (a) is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7(1) the trust is a trust effected by will holding only the estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was effected by will` IS TRUE, `the person was beneficially entitled to all the property the trust holds` IS FALSE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a trust effected by will
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7(1) the trust is a trust effected by will holding only the estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was effected by will` IS FALSE, `the person was beneficially entitled to all the property the trust holds` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

