-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7+1 the trust holds only death benefits of a policy within paragraph 4 within two years of the death` WITH `the trust holds only benefits received on the death of the person assured under a policy within paragraph 4` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
