#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7+2 the trust is created under a deed or instrument varying dispositions of an estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was created under a deed or instrument` IS TRUE, `the deed or instrument varies any of the dispositions of property comprised in the estate on death of a person` IS TRUE, `the deed or instrument was made by the persons or any of the persons who benefit or would benefit from the dispositions` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
