#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7+2 the trust is created under a deed or instrument varying dispositions of an estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was created under a deed or instrument` IS TRUE, `the deed or instrument varies any of the dispositions of property comprised in the estate on death of a person` IS FALSE, `the deed or instrument was made by the persons or any of the persons who benefit or would benefit from the dispositions` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) made by someone who does not benefit from the dispositions
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7+2 the trust is created under a deed or instrument varying dispositions of an estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was created under a deed or instrument` IS TRUE, `the deed or instrument varies any of the dispositions of property comprised in the estate on death of a person` IS TRUE, `the deed or instrument was made by the persons or any of the persons who benefit or would benefit from the dispositions` IS FALSE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not created under a deed or instrument
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 7+2 the trust is created under a deed or instrument varying dispositions of an estate within two years of the death` WITH `the trust was created under a deed or instrument` IS FALSE, `the deed or instrument varies any of the dispositions of property comprised in the estate on death of a person` IS TRUE, `the deed or instrument was made by the persons or any of the persons who benefit or would benefit from the dispositions` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of the person` IS (Date 10 6 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 9 6 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 9 -- para 9 the trust is a co-ownership trust`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9 the trust is a co-ownership trust` WITH `the trust is of jointly held property` IS TRUE, `the trustees and the beneficiaries are the same persons` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the trustees and the beneficiaries are not the same persons: the "where" is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9 the trust is a co-ownership trust` WITH `the trust is of jointly held property` IS TRUE, `the trustees and the beneficiaries are the same persons` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a trust of jointly held property
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9 the trust is a co-ownership trust` WITH `the trust is of jointly held property` IS FALSE, `the trustees and the beneficiaries are the same persons` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 9+1 -- para 9+1 the trust is a trust which ceases to be an excluded trust und`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9+1 the trust is a trust which ceases to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9 within two years of a trustee's death` WITH `the trust ceased to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9` IS TRUE, `the sole reason for paragraph 9 ceasing to apply is the death of one of the trustees` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of that trustee` IS (Date 5 5 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 4 5 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) the day before the second anniversary of the death
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9+1 the trust is a trust which ceases to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9 within two years of a trustee's death` WITH `the trust ceased to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9` IS TRUE, `the sole reason for paragraph 9 ceasing to apply is the death of one of the trustees` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of that trustee` IS (Date 5 5 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 4 5 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) the second anniversary itself: outside the period
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9+1 the trust is a trust which ceases to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9 within two years of a trustee's death` WITH `the trust ceased to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9` IS TRUE, `the sole reason for paragraph 9 ceasing to apply is the death of one of the trustees` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of that trustee` IS (Date 5 5 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 5 5 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a) paragraph 9 ceased to apply for some other reason: the "where" in (a) is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9+1 the trust is a trust which ceases to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9 within two years of a trustee's death` WITH `the trust ceased to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9` IS TRUE, `the sole reason for paragraph 9 ceasing to apply is the death of one of the trustees` IS FALSE, `the date of the death of that trustee` IS (Date 5 5 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 4 5 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the trust has not ceased to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 9+1 the trust is a trust which ceases to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9 within two years of a trustee's death` WITH `the trust ceased to be an excluded trust under paragraph 9` IS FALSE, `the sole reason for paragraph 9 ceasing to apply is the death of one of the trustees` IS TRUE, `the date of the death of that trustee` IS (Date 5 5 2024), `the date for which the trust is being tested` IS (Date 4 5 2026)) EQUALS NOTHING

