#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 10(1) the trust is a financial markets infrastructure trust` WITH `the trust was created under, or for the purpose of, the default arrangements of a designated system or of the default rules of a recognised body, or for the purpose of any action or proceedings taken by or for such a system or body under such arrangements or rules` IS FALSE, `the trust relates to the creation of a beneficial interest in securities belonging to a person whose name and address are maintained on a register of securities` IS FALSE, `the entity is an authorised person` IS FALSE, `the entity is a clearing member of a recognised central counterparty` IS FALSE, `the entity is a participant in a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a recognised body` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of complying with a legal obligation to safeguard and segregate sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients or to keep separate client records and accounts` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c)(ii) a purpose but the entity is not a segregating entity
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 10(1) the trust is a financial markets infrastructure trust` WITH `the trust was created under, or for the purpose of, the default arrangements of a designated system or of the default rules of a recognised body, or for the purpose of any action or proceedings taken by or for such a system or body under such arrangements or rules` IS FALSE, `the trust relates to the creation of a beneficial interest in securities belonging to a person whose name and address are maintained on a register of securities` IS FALSE, `the entity is an authorised person` IS FALSE, `the entity is a clearing member of a recognised central counterparty` IS FALSE, `the entity is a participant in a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a recognised body` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of complying with a legal obligation to safeguard and segregate sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients or to keep separate client records and accounts` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a) holds, so (c) is not reached: the entity does not matter
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 10(1) the trust is a financial markets infrastructure trust` WITH `the trust was created under, or for the purpose of, the default arrangements of a designated system or of the default rules of a recognised body, or for the purpose of any action or proceedings taken by or for such a system or body under such arrangements or rules` IS TRUE, `the trust relates to the creation of a beneficial interest in securities belonging to a person whose name and address are maintained on a register of securities` IS FALSE, `the entity is an authorised person` IS FALSE, `the entity is a clearing member of a recognised central counterparty` IS FALSE, `the entity is a participant in a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a recognised body` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of complying with a legal obligation to safeguard and segregate sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients or to keep separate client records and accounts` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- none of (a), (b), (c)
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 10(1) the trust is a financial markets infrastructure trust` WITH `the trust was created under, or for the purpose of, the default arrangements of a designated system or of the default rules of a recognised body, or for the purpose of any action or proceedings taken by or for such a system or body under such arrangements or rules` IS FALSE, `the trust relates to the creation of a beneficial interest in securities belonging to a person whose name and address are maintained on a register of securities` IS FALSE, `the entity is an authorised person` IS FALSE, `the entity is a clearing member of a recognised central counterparty` IS FALSE, `the entity is a participant in a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a designated system` IS FALSE, `the entity is a recognised body` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of complying with a legal obligation to safeguard and segregate sums or assets belonging to the segregating entity's clients or to keep separate client records and accounts` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 11 -- para 11 the trust is a professional services trust`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 11 the trust is a professional services trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of sums or assets belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of documents belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trustee is carrying on by way of business the activity specified in article 40 (safeguarding and administering investments) of the Regulated Activities Order 2001` IS TRUE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as an agent holding sums, assets or documents in escrow until the performance of a contractual condition` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 11 the trust is a professional services trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of sums or assets belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of documents belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trustee is carrying on by way of business the activity specified in article 40 (safeguarding and administering investments) of the Regulated Activities Order 2001` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme` IS TRUE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as an agent holding sums, assets or documents in escrow until the performance of a contractual condition` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) an escrow agent holding sums or assets
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 11 the trust is a professional services trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of sums or assets belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of documents belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trustee is carrying on by way of business the activity specified in article 40 (safeguarding and administering investments) of the Regulated Activities Order 2001` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as an agent holding sums, assets or documents in escrow until the performance of a contractual condition` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- documents count only in the case of (c): an escrow agent holding documents
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 11 the trust is a professional services trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of sums or assets belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of documents belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS TRUE, `the trustee is carrying on by way of business the activity specified in article 40 (safeguarding and administering investments) of the Regulated Activities Order 2001` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as an agent holding sums, assets or documents in escrow until the performance of a contractual condition` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- documents with a trustee within (a) only: 'in the case of sub-paragraph (c)'
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 11 the trust is a professional services trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of sums or assets belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of documents belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS TRUE, `the trustee is carrying on by way of business the activity specified in article 40 (safeguarding and administering investments) of the Regulated Activities Order 2001` IS TRUE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as an agent holding sums, assets or documents in escrow until the performance of a contractual condition` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- sums or assets but the trustee is within none of (a), (b), (c)
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 11 the trust is a professional services trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of sums or assets belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of documents belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trustee is carrying on by way of business the activity specified in article 40 (safeguarding and administering investments) of the Regulated Activities Order 2001` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as an agent holding sums, assets or documents in escrow until the performance of a contractual condition` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the trust is not for holding sums, assets or documents belonging to another
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 11 the trust is a professional services trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of sums or assets belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating the holding of documents belonging to a person other than the trustee` IS FALSE, `the trustee is carrying on by way of business the activity specified in article 40 (safeguarding and administering investments) of the Regulated Activities Order 2001` IS TRUE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as the trustee of an authorised unit trust scheme` IS FALSE, `the trustee is acting by way of business as an agent holding sums, assets or documents in escrow until the performance of a contractual condition` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 12 -- para 12 the trust is a client money trust`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 12 the trust is a client money trust` WITH `the creator is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the trust was created for the purpose of holding client money, securities or other assets` IS TRUE, `the trust is incidental to the carrying on of business by the relevant supervised person` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the creator is not a relevant supervised person: the definition says no and passes through the head
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 12 the trust is a client money trust` WITH `the creator is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST FALSE), `the trust was created for the purpose of holding client money, securities or other assets` IS TRUE, `the trust is incidental to the carrying on of business by the relevant supervised person` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- it is not known whether the creator is a relevant supervised person
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 12 the trust is a client money trust` WITH `the creator is a relevant supervised person` IS NOTHING, `the trust was created for the purpose of holding client money, securities or other assets` IS TRUE, `the trust is incidental to the carrying on of business by the relevant supervised person` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not created to hold client money, securities or other assets
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 12 the trust is a client money trust` WITH `the creator is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the trust was created for the purpose of holding client money, securities or other assets` IS FALSE, `the trust is incidental to the carrying on of business by the relevant supervised person` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not incidental to the business: the "where" is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 12 the trust is a client money trust` WITH `the creator is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the trust was created for the purpose of holding client money, securities or other assets` IS TRUE, `the trust is incidental to the carrying on of business by the relevant supervised person` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `sch 3A para 13 -- para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating an activity listed in points 2, 3, 6, 7 or 8 of Schedule 2` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to that activity` IS FALSE, `one or more of the participants in that activity is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of that activity` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the purpose is protecting or enforcing rights relating to the activity
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating an activity listed in points 2, 3, 6, 7 or 8 of Schedule 2` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to that activity` IS TRUE, `one or more of the participants in that activity is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of that activity` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither purpose
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating an activity listed in points 2, 3, 6, 7 or 8 of Schedule 2` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to that activity` IS FALSE, `one or more of the participants in that activity is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of that activity` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (a) no participant is a relevant supervised person: the "where" is not met, and the definition says no
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating an activity listed in points 2, 3, 6, 7 or 8 of Schedule 2` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to that activity` IS FALSE, `one or more of the participants in that activity is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST FALSE), `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of that activity` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a) not known whether a participant is a relevant supervised person
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating an activity listed in points 2, 3, 6, 7 or 8 of Schedule 2` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to that activity` IS FALSE, `one or more of the participants in that activity is a relevant supervised person` IS NOTHING, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of that activity` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not incidental to the principal purpose: the "where" is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating an activity listed in points 2, 3, 6, 7 or 8 of Schedule 2` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to that activity` IS FALSE, `one or more of the participants in that activity is a relevant supervised person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of that activity` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a) not known and (b) not met: (b) alone fails the "where"
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 13 the trust is a capital markets trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating an activity listed in points 2, 3, 6, 7 or 8 of Schedule 2` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to that activity` IS FALSE, `one or more of the participants in that activity is a relevant supervised person` IS NOTHING, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of that activity` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `sch 3A para 14 -- para 14 the trust is a commercial transactions trust`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 14 the trust is a commercial transactions trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating a transaction effected for genuine commercial reasons` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction` IS FALSE, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of the transaction` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 14 the trust is a commercial transactions trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating a transaction effected for genuine commercial reasons` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction` IS TRUE, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of the transaction` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither (a) nor (b)
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 14 the trust is a commercial transactions trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating a transaction effected for genuine commercial reasons` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction` IS FALSE, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of the transaction` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the use of the trust is not incidental: the "where" is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 14 the trust is a commercial transactions trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating a transaction effected for genuine commercial reasons` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction` IS FALSE, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of the transaction` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `sch 3A para 15 -- para 15 the trust is a registration of assets trust`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 15 the trust is a registration of assets trust` WITH `the trust was created on the transfer or disposal of an asset` IS TRUE, `the purpose of the trust is to hold the legal title to the asset on trust for the person to whom the transfer or disposal is being made until the procedure required by law to effect the transfer or disposal of legal title is completed` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- another purpose: the "where" is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 15 the trust is a registration of assets trust` WITH `the trust was created on the transfer or disposal of an asset` IS TRUE, `the purpose of the trust is to hold the legal title to the asset on trust for the person to whom the transfer or disposal is being made until the procedure required by law to effect the transfer or disposal of legal title is completed` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not created on a transfer or disposal
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 15 the trust is a registration of assets trust` WITH `the trust was created on the transfer or disposal of an asset` IS FALSE, `the purpose of the trust is to hold the legal title to the asset on trust for the person to whom the transfer or disposal is being made until the procedure required by law to effect the transfer or disposal of legal title is completed` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 16 -- para 16 the trust holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the In`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16 the trust holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` WITH `the trust holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16 the trust holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` WITH `the trust holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 16+1 -- para 16+1 the trust is of property subject to a direction under paragr`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+1 the trust is of property subject to a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984` WITH `the trust is of property in respect of which a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 has effect` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+1 the trust is of property subject to a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984` WITH `the trust is of property in respect of which a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 has effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 16+2 -- para 16+2 the trust is a trust of funds derived from a personal injury`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+2 the trust is a trust of funds derived from a personal injury payment` WITH `the trust is of funds derived from a payment` IS TRUE, `the payment was made for the benefit of a person in consequence of a personal injury to that person` IS TRUE, `the payment was disregarded from capital under regulation 46(2) of, and paragraph 12 of Schedule 10 to, the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) not made in consequence of a personal injury
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+2 the trust is a trust of funds derived from a personal injury payment` WITH `the trust is of funds derived from a payment` IS TRUE, `the payment was made for the benefit of a person in consequence of a personal injury to that person` IS FALSE, `the payment was disregarded from capital under regulation 46(2) of, and paragraph 12 of Schedule 10 to, the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not disregarded from capital
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+2 the trust is a trust of funds derived from a personal injury payment` WITH `the trust is of funds derived from a payment` IS TRUE, `the payment was made for the benefit of a person in consequence of a personal injury to that person` IS TRUE, `the payment was disregarded from capital under regulation 46(2) of, and paragraph 12 of Schedule 10 to, the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not funds derived from a payment
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+2 the trust is a trust of funds derived from a personal injury payment` WITH `the trust is of funds derived from a payment` IS FALSE, `the payment was made for the benefit of a person in consequence of a personal injury to that person` IS TRUE, `the payment was disregarded from capital under regulation 46(2) of, and paragraph 12 of Schedule 10 to, the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 16+3 -- para 16+3 the trust holds tenants' contributions`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+3 the trust holds tenants' contributions` WITH `the trust holds tenants' contributions for the purposes of section 42 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+3 the trust holds tenants' contributions` WITH `the trust holds tenants' contributions for the purposes of section 42 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 16+4 -- para 16+4 the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+4 the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` WITH `the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` IS TRUE, `the share incentive plan meets the requirements of Part 9 of Schedule 2 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the plan does not meet the requirements
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+4 the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` WITH `the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` IS TRUE, `the share incentive plan meets the requirements of Part 9 of Schedule 2 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not the plan trust of a share incentive plan
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+4 the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` WITH `the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` IS FALSE, `the share incentive plan meets the requirements of Part 9 of Schedule 2 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 16+5 -- para 16+5 the trust is created under a share option scheme`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+5 the trust is created under a share option scheme` WITH `the trust was created under a share option scheme` IS TRUE, `the share option scheme meets the requirements of Parts 2 to 7 of Schedule 3 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the scheme does not meet the requirements
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+5 the trust is created under a share option scheme` WITH `the trust was created under a share option scheme` IS TRUE, `the share option scheme meets the requirements of Parts 2 to 7 of Schedule 3 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not created under a share option scheme
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+5 the trust is created under a share option scheme` WITH `the trust was created under a share option scheme` IS FALSE, `the share option scheme meets the requirements of Parts 2 to 7 of Schedule 3 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 16+6 -- para 16+6 the trust holds property for a disabled beneficiary`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+6 the trust holds property for a disabled beneficiary` WITH `the trust holds property for a beneficiary who is a disabled person within the meaning given by Schedule 1A to the Finance Act 2005` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 16+6 the trust holds property for a disabled beneficiary` WITH `the trust holds property for a beneficiary who is a disabled person within the meaning given by Schedule 1A to the Finance Act 2005` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 23 -- para 23 the trust is a public authorities trust`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23 the trust is a public authorities trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) a Scottish public authority
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23 the trust is a public authorities trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) the Security Service, SIS, GCHQ or the NCA
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23 the trust is a public authorities trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (d) the Welsh Assembly Government
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23 the trust is a public authorities trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS TRUE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- none of (a) to (d)
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23 the trust is a public authorities trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not to carry out its functions
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23 the trust is a public authorities trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 23A(3) -- para 23A(3) the asset is an asset of appreciable worth`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A(3) the asset is an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A a work of art`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an antique
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A(3) the asset is an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A an antique`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a collectible
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A(3) the asset is an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A a collectible`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- jewellery
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A(3) the asset is an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A jewellery`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- another non-financial asset capable of increasing in value over time
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A(3) the asset is an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A another non-financial asset capable of increasing in value over time`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 'includes' opens the list: an asset of another kind is not said to be outside it
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A(3) the asset is an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A an asset of another kind`) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 3A para 23A -- para 23A the trust is within the general exclusion`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A the trust is within the general exclusion` WITH `the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the total value of the assets of appreciable worth that the trust holds` IS 2000, `the cumulative total value of the property the trust has held since it was created` IS 10000, `the income of the trust per annum` IS 5000, `the trust is a UK trust which is an express trust` IS FALSE, `the settlor has, during his or her lifetime, created one or more other UK trusts which are express trusts` IS FALSE, `one of the trusts mentioned in paragraph 23A(2)(a) is or was an excluded trust under paragraph 23A` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (1)(a) the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom
