-- (2) a UK express trust whose settlor made another UK express trust that is or was excluded under this paragraph: 'does not apply'
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A the trust is within the general exclusion` WITH `the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the total value of the assets of appreciable worth that the trust holds` IS 2000, `the cumulative total value of the property the trust has held since it was created` IS 10000, `the income of the trust per annum` IS 5000, `the trust is a UK trust which is an express trust` IS TRUE, `the settlor has, during his or her lifetime, created one or more other UK trusts which are express trusts` IS TRUE, `one of the trusts mentioned in paragraph 23A(2)(a) is or was an excluded trust under paragraph 23A` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (2)(b) not met: the other trust was never excluded under this paragraph
