-- (2)(a) not met: the settlor created no other UK express trust
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A the trust is within the general exclusion` WITH `the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the total value of the assets of appreciable worth that the trust holds` IS 2000, `the cumulative total value of the property the trust has held since it was created` IS 10000, `the income of the trust per annum` IS 5000, `the trust is a UK trust which is an express trust` IS TRUE, `the settlor has, during his or her lifetime, created one or more other UK trusts which are express trusts` IS FALSE, `one of the trusts mentioned in paragraph 23A(2)(a) is or was an excluded trust under paragraph 23A` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not a UK express trust: (2) does not bite
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 23A the trust is within the general exclusion` WITH `the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the total value of the assets of appreciable worth that the trust holds` IS 2000, `the cumulative total value of the property the trust has held since it was created` IS 10000, `the income of the trust per annum` IS 5000, `the trust is a UK trust which is an express trust` IS FALSE, `the settlor has, during his or her lifetime, created one or more other UK trusts which are express trusts` IS TRUE, `one of the trusts mentioned in paragraph 23A(2)(a) is or was an excluded trust under paragraph 23A` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
