§ `sch 3A para 24 -- para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person`

-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS FALSE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) a relevant person
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS (JUST TRUE), `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS FALSE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) not a relevant person but subject to and supervised under equivalent requirements
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS TRUE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) subject to equivalent requirements but not supervised in the equivalent manner
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS TRUE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 'means': neither (a) nor (b)
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS FALSE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a) not known whether a relevant person, (b) met
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS NOTHING, `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS TRUE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) not known whether a relevant person, (b) not met: not covered
#ASSERT (`sch 3A para 24 the person is a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS NOTHING, `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS FALSE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

